# Nine-slice frame, 4px border. Every button and panel in the game.
#
# The top edge is bright and the bottom edge is dark, so a frame stretched to
# any size still reads as lit from above — the corners carry the light, which
# is exactly the part a nine-slice never scales.
name battlegrid-ui-frame
size 16 16
key o outline
key H cyan-2
key d void-2
key m void-1
pixels
oooooooooooooooo
oHHHHHHHHHHHHHHo
oHooooooooooooHo
oHoddddddddddoHo
*8 oHodmmmmmmmmdoHo
oHoddddddddddoHo
oHooooooooooooHo
oddddddddddddddo
oooooooooooooooo
